WEBVTT

1
00:00:52,208 --> 00:00:57,833
<i>In the beginning,</i>
<i>there was only ocean...</i>

2
00:01:03,291 --> 00:01:06,416
<i>until she emerged.</i>

3
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:11,083
<i>Our mother island, Te Fiti.</i>

4
00:01:12,625 --> 00:01:18,208
<i>Her heart held the power</i>
<i>to create life itself...</i>

5
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,333
<i>and Te Fiti shared it with the world.</i>

6
00:01:25,666 --> 00:01:26,666
<i>In time,</i>

7
00:01:26,750 --> 00:01:30,541
<i>some sought to capture</i>
<i>the heart for themselves.</i>

8
00:01:30,625 --> 00:01:34,291
<i>For they believed,</i>
<i>if they could possess it,</i>

9
00:01:34,916 --> 00:01:38,333
<i>the power of creation would be theirs.</i>

10
00:01:41,125 --> 00:01:44,416
<i>And one day, the most daring of them all</i>

11
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:48,833
<i>voyaged across the vast ocean to take it.</i>

12
00:01:49,250 --> 00:01:52,833
<i>He was a demigod of the wind and sea.</i>

13
00:01:52,916 --> 00:01:55,000
Whoo-hoo!

14
00:01:55,083 --> 00:01:56,250
<i>A warrior.</i>

15
00:01:58,208 --> 00:02:00,083
<i>- A trickster.</i>

16
00:02:01,083 --> 00:02:04,083
Chee Hoo!

17
00:02:05,666 --> 00:02:08,833
<i>- A shape-shifter...</i>

18
00:02:08,916 --> 00:02:13,625
<i>...who could change form</i>
<i>with the power of his magical fish hook.</i>

19
00:02:14,208 --> 00:02:18,625
<i>And his name was Maui.</i>

20
00:02:31,833 --> 00:02:33,666
She was rumbling
before we got here, right?

21
00:02:38,166 --> 00:02:43,625
<i>But without her heart,</i>
<i>Te Fiti began to crumble,</i>

22
00:02:43,708 --> 00:02:47,041
<i>giving birth to a terrible darkness.</i>

23
00:02:51,750 --> 00:02:53,791
<i>Maui tried to escape,</i>

24
00:02:53,875 --> 00:02:58,000
<i>but was confronted by another</i>
<i>who sought the heart.</i>

25
00:02:59,625 --> 00:03:04,083
<i>Te Kā! A demon of earth and fire.</i>

26
00:03:05,791 --> 00:03:08,041
<i>Maui was struck from the sky...</i>

27
00:03:09,416 --> 00:03:12,708
<i>...never to be seen again.</i>

28
00:03:12,791 --> 00:03:17,500
<i>And his magical fish hook</i>
<i>and the heart of Te Fiti</i>

29
00:03:17,583 --> 00:03:19,666
<i>were lost to the sea,</i>

30
00:03:19,750 --> 00:03:24,000
<i>where, even now, a thousand years later,</i>

31
00:03:24,083 --> 00:03:26,333
<i>Te Kā and the demons of the deep</i>

32
00:03:26,416 --> 00:03:29,250
<i>still hunt for the heart.</i>

33
00:03:29,333 --> 00:03:33,541
<i>Hiding in a darkness</i>
<i>that will continue to spread.</i>

34
00:03:33,625 --> 00:03:38,708
<i>Draining the life</i>
<i>from island after island,</i>

35
00:03:38,791 --> 00:03:41,083
until we are all devoured

36
00:03:41,166 --> 00:03:46,916
by the bloodthirsty
inescapable jaws of death!

37
00:03:48,541 --> 00:03:52,125
But one day, the heart will be found

38
00:03:53,125 --> 00:03:57,916
by someone who will journey
beyond our reef,

39
00:03:58,625 --> 00:04:01,041
find Maui,

40
00:04:01,125 --> 00:04:04,916
deliver him across the great ocean

41
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:08,666
to restore the heart of Te Fiti

42
00:04:09,166 --> 00:04:12,916
