43
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,541
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

44
00:04:16,208 --> 00:04:17,750
Thank you, Mother.

45
00:04:18,291 --> 00:04:20,125
- Papa.
- There she is.

46
00:04:20,625 --> 00:04:24,458
As you all know,
no one goes beyond the reef.

47
00:04:24,541 --> 00:04:25,750
We are safe here.

48
