As long as we stay
on our very safe island,

52
00:04:43,041 --> 00:04:44,750
we'll be fine.

53
00:04:44,833 --> 00:04:47,291
<i>The legends are true, Son.</i>

54
00:05:17,083 --> 00:05:20,000
Don't worry. I'll help you.

55
00:05:20,083 --> 00:05:22,291
Shoo! Shoo, shoo!

56
00:05:23,041 --> 00:05:24,125
Leave him alone.

57
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,500
Wanna go to the ocean?

58
00:05:28,500 --> 00:05:30,250
Yeah, me too.

59
00:05:44,166 --> 00:05:45,458
