73
00:07:32,458 --> 00:07:33,375
No.

74
00:07:35,666 --> 00:07:37,041
Never pass the reef.

75
00:07:37,666 --> 00:07:38,708
Come on.

76
00:07:38,791 --> 00:07:41,791
