♪ <i>We have mouths to feed inside </i>♪

154
00:11:53,208 --> 00:11:54,333
♪ <i>The village believes in us </i>♪

155
00:11:54,416 --> 00:11:55,250
♪ <i>That's right </i>♪

156
00:11:55,333 --> 00:11:56,791
♪ <i>The village believes </i>♪

157
