160
00:12:02,875 --> 00:12:05,250
♪ <i>My home, my people beside me </i>♪

161
00:12:05,333 --> 00:12:09,416
♪ <i>And when I think of tomorrow</i>
<i>There we are </i>♪

162
00:12:09,500 --> 00:12:10,666
♪ <i>I'll lead the way </i>♪

163
00:12:10,750 --> 00:12:12,958
♪ <i>I'll have my people to guide me </i>♪

164
00:12:13,041 --> 00:12:17,375
♪ <i>We'll build our future</i>
<i>Together, where we are </i>♪

165
00:12:17,458 --> 00:12:19,000
♪<i> 'Cause every path leads you back to </i>♪

166
00:12:19,083 --> 00:12:21,208
♪ <i>Where you are </i>♪

167
00:12:21,291 --> 00:12:25,250
♪ <i>You can find happiness</i>
<i>Right where you are </i>♪

168
00:12:25,333 --> 00:12:32,125
♪ <i>Where you are</i>
<i>Where you are </i>♪

169
00:12:32,583 --> 00:12:35,083
Chee Hoo!

170
00:12:38,375 --> 00:12:40,916
Yeah, yeah. Pull it.

171
00:12:41,625 --> 00:12:42,750
Pull it tight.

172
00:12:48,416 --> 00:12:50,916
Careful, Heihei. Stay.

173
00:12:54,041 --> 00:12:55,750
