180
00:13:52,041 --> 00:13:53,125
Over there.

181
00:13:53,791 --> 00:13:55,208
It's getting worse.

182
00:13:55,291 --> 00:13:57,500
We should clear any diseased trees.

183
00:13:57,583 --> 00:13:59,666
Replant. Let us know if you find more.

184
00:14:00,958 --> 00:14:03,458
"Leader of the people."

185
00:14:05,958 --> 00:14:09,666
This is "playful, but fierce."

186
00:14:12,916 --> 00:14:14,208
It's important, Pua.

187
00:14:18,625 --> 00:14:19,791
It's forever.

188
00:14:20,625 --> 00:14:22,500
None of those boats have fish.

189
00:14:22,583 --> 00:14:23,833
We checked everywhere.

190
00:14:26,458 --> 00:14:28,916
- I looked over there.
- We need to let the chief...

191
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:30,541
