What he needs.

223
00:16:24,083 --> 00:16:26,291
But it doesn't seem to be enough for him.

224
00:16:28,250 --> 00:16:30,166
He was just like you, Moana.

225
00:16:30,833 --> 00:16:32,333
- Dad?
- Mm-hmm.

226
00:16:32,916 --> 00:16:34,875
Drawn to the ocean.

227
00:16:35,416 --> 00:16:38,875
Ignoring the warning,
"Don't cross the reef."

228
00:16:46,458 --> 00:16:48,250
He took a canoe...

229
00:16:50,375 --> 00:16:53,791
