<i>and found an unforgiving sea.</i>

230
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:57,125
<i>Waves like mountains.</i>

231
00:16:57,208 --> 00:16:59,958
His cousin begged to be on that boat.

232
00:17:02,875 --> 00:17:04,708
Your dad couldn't save him.

233
00:17:05,458 --> 00:17:08,916
He's hoping he can save you.

234
00:17:13,583 --> 00:17:18,708
Sometimes who we wish we were
and who we need to be,

235
00:17:19,583 --> 00:17:20,791
they don't match up.

236
00:17:49,708 --> 00:17:54,333
♪ <i>I've been staring</i>
<i>At the edge of the water </i>♪

237
00:17:54,416 --> 00:17:57,875
♪ <i>Long as I can remember </i>♪

238
00:17:57,958 --> 00:18:01,000
♪ <i>Never really knowing why </i>♪

239
00:18:03,041 --> 00:18:07,666
