01:09:06,833 --> 01:09:09,750
♪ <i>Soak it in cuz it's the last</i>
<i>You'll ever see </i>♪

973
01:09:09,833 --> 01:09:13,083
♪ <i>C'est la vie, mon ami</i>
<i>I'm so shiny </i>♪

974
01:09:13,166 --> 01:09:16,625
♪ <i>Now I eat you</i>
<i>So prepare your final plea </i>♪

975
01:09:16,708 --> 01:09:18,583
♪ <i>Just for me </i>♪

976
01:09:18,666 --> 01:09:21,791
♪ <i>You'll never be quite as shiny </i>♪

977
01:09:21,875 --> 01:09:26,750
♪ <i>You wish you were nice 'n' shiny </i>♪

978
01:09:28,458 --> 01:09:30,041
- Hey!
- Huh?

979
01:09:31,958 --> 01:09:33,625
I got something shiny for ya.

980
01:09:33,708 --> 01:09:35,583
The heart of Te Fiti.

981
01:09:35,666 --> 01:09:36,708
Don't give it to him, kid.

982
01:09:36,791 --> 01:09:39,666
You want it? Come and get it.

983
01:09:39,750 --> 01:09:42,000
You can't run from me.

984
01:09:42,916 --> 01:09:45,500
Oh, you can. You keep surprising me.

985
01:09:48,166 --> 01:09:51,875
There's only so far you can
get on those two little legs.

986
01:09:51,958 --> 01:09:53,166
- You tripped.

987
01:09:53,250 --> 01:09:55,958
Bad luck. -

988
01:09:56,041 --> 01:10:00,208
Oh, the power of creation
for a crustacean.

989
01:10:00,291 --> 01:10:04,375
Oh. Where is it? Where is it?

990
01:10:05,625 --> 01:10:07,416
Come on, Te Fiti.

991
01:10:07,916 --> 01:10:09,708
Time to go. Shall we?

992
01:10:10,583 --> 01:10:12,458
- What about the heart?
- He can have it.

993
01:10:12,541 --> 01:10:14,000
I've got a better one.

994
01:10:14,083 --> 01:10:16,958
Yes! It is mine! It's...

995
01:10:17,041 --> 01:10:18,083
Wait a minute.

996
01:10:18,166 --> 01:10:19,833
I see, she's taken a barnacle

997
01:10:19,916 --> 01:10:22,708
and she's covered it
in bioluminescent algae

998
01:10:22,791 --> 01:10:23,916
as a diversion.

999
01:10:25,458 --> 01:10:27,500
- Come back here!
- Over there!

1000
01:10:28,583 --> 01:10:30,666
There is no escape.

1001
01:10:30,750 --> 01:10:33,875
- And jump!
- Chee Hoo!

1002
01:10:33,958 --> 01:10:35,708
Oh, there is one escape.

1003
01:10:35,791 --> 01:10:37,416
Hey, did you like the song?

1004
01:10:37,500 --> 01:10:39,791
Did you have any notes or feedback?

1005
01:10:49,833 --> 01:10:52,500
Maui. Maui.

1006
01:10:55,666 --> 01:10:56,708
Ma--

1007
01:10:57,333 --> 01:11:00,958
Listen, I, uh, really appreciate
what you did down there.

1008
01:11:01,041 --> 01:11:02,833
That took guts. And I...

1009
01:11:03,708 --> 01:11:05,541
Oh. I get it.

1010
01:11:05,625 --> 01:11:07,916
Big, tough, handsome guy gets emotional.

1011
01:11:08,000 --> 01:11:10,875
And what do you do? You laugh in his face.

1012
01:11:10,958 --> 01:11:13,458
It's just you... you got this like...

1013
01:11:13,541 --> 01:11:15,541
Oh, no. Is there something on my face?

1014
01:11:16,041 --> 01:11:18,708
In my teeth? Is there
something in my teeth?

1015
01:11:18,791 --> 01:11:21,500
No, no. No, no, no. Shark head.

1016
01:11:21,583 --> 01:11:24,416
I-I like this part. I mean...
I mean the nice part.

1017
01:11:24,500 --> 01:11:27,833
I-I was not making fun
of the shark portion.

1018
01:11:27,916 --> 01:11:31,375
Look, the point is you did me a solid.

1019
01:11:31,458 --> 01:11:33,375
But you almost died.

1020
01:11:33,458 --> 01:11:35,458
And I couldn't even beat the dumb crab.

1021
01:11:35,541 --> 01:11:38,791
So, chances of beating Te Kā
are bubkes.

1022
01:11:38,875 --> 01:11:42,541
This mission has no chance
because you're still you

1023
01:11:42,625 --> 01:11:44,041
and I have a shark head.

1024
01:11:46,416 --> 01:11:49,208
♪ <i>Hey, it's okay, it's okay </i>♪

1025
01:11:49,291 --> 01:11:51,000
♪ <i>There's no wind </i>♪

1026
01:11:51,708 --> 01:11:56,166
♪ <i>We're dead soon</i>
<i>We're dead soon </i>♪

1027
01:11:56,250 --> 01:12:00,541
♪ <i>'Cause we're both gonna die</i>
<i>On this boat, hey </i>♪

1028
01:12:00,625 --> 01:12:02,750
Maybe try it with a smile.

1029
01:12:03,291 --> 01:12:04,708
Giant hawk.

1030
01:12:10,333 --> 01:12:14,791
♪ <i>Maui's gonna do</i>
<i>The dead man's float, hey </i>♪

1031
01:12:14,875 --> 01:12:16,208
Why are you being like this?

1032
01:12:16,291 --> 01:12:18,375
Leave me alone.

1033
01:12:22,541 --> 01:12:24,000
Both of you, leave me alone.

1034
01:12:27,708 --> 01:12:30,833
How do you get your tattoos?

1035
01:12:30,916 --> 01:12:34,250
They just show up... when I earn 'em.

1036
01:12:35,125 --> 01:12:36,125
They just show up.

1037
01:12:36,666 --> 01:12:38,750
How did you get that one?

1038
01:12:41,166 --> 01:12:43,125
That one's man's discovery of Nunya.

1039
01:12:43,208 --> 01:12:44,541
- What's Nunya?
- Nunya business.

1040
01:12:44,625 --> 01:12:46,916
- I'm just gonna keep asking.
- Drop it.

1041
01:12:47,000 --> 01:12:48,000
Why was that crab poking at it?

1042
01:12:48,083 --> 01:12:49,083
- Back off.
- What is it?

1043
01:12:49,166 --> 01:12:50,250
- No.
- What is it?

1044
01:12:50,333 --> 01:12:51,333
I don't want to talk about it.

1045
01:12:51,416 --> 01:12:52,375
Give it back!

1046
01:13:06,333 --> 01:13:09,083
If you don't want to talk, that's fine.

1047
01:13:10,791 --> 01:13:13,541
But my island, my people...

1048
01:13:15,500 --> 01:13:16,916
my family...

1049
01:13:19,625 --> 01:13:21,583
they won't survive if we don't make it.

1050
01:13:23,375 --> 01:13:24,750
I want to help.

1051
01:13:26,083 --> 01:13:27,416
If you let me.

1052
01:13:41,208 --> 01:13:42,958
I wasn't born a demigod.

1053
01:13:47,291 --> 01:13:48,875
I had human parents.

1054
01:13:50,541 --> 01:13:51,916
Who decided they didn't want me.

1055
01:13:54,958 --> 01:13:57,916
So they threw me in the ocean,
like I was nothing.

1056
01:13:58,791 --> 01:14:00,791
Somehow, I washed ashore.

1057
01:14:02,083 --> 01:14:03,375
Found by the gods.

1058
01:14:04,958 --> 01:14:06,291
They gave me my hook.

1059
01:14:07,416 --> 01:14:08,958
They made me Maui.

1060
01:14:10,125 --> 01:14:12,500
So back to the humans I went.

1061
01:14:13,541 --> 01:14:15,083
I gave them everything.

1062
01:14:16,083 --> 01:14:17,291
Islands,

1063
01:14:18,875 --> 01:14:20,125
fire,

1064
01:14:21,833 --> 01:14:23,041
coconuts.

1065
01:14:25,583 --> 01:14:27,708
I gave them anything they ever wanted.

1066
01:14:29,416 --> 01:14:31,875
You took the heart for us.

1067
01:14:34,041 --> 01:14:36,125
You did everything for us.

1068
01:14:37,625 --> 01:14:38,791
So we'd love you.

1069
01:14:41,708 --> 01:14:42,708
Yes.

1070
01:14:46,083 --> 01:14:47,166
It was never enough.

1071
01:14:47,250 --> 01:14:50,333
The ocean chose you too.

1072
01:14:50,416 --> 01:14:51,875
That's your takeaway?

1073
01:14:51,958 --> 01:14:55,583
Because it saw someone
worthy of being saved.

1074
01:14:55,666 --> 01:14:56,916
And what am I now?

1075
01:14:57,000 --> 01:14:58,208
You're Maui.

1076
01:14:59,666 --> 01:15:01,750
The gods didn't make that true.

1077
01:15:03,125 --> 01:15:04,333
You did.

1078
01:15:06,875 --> 01:15:08,583
Okay.

1079
01:15:09,666 --> 01:15:10,625
Okay.

1080
01:15:10,708 --> 01:15:12,250
Not in front of the guest.

1081
01:15:22,541 --> 01:15:23,541
The wind.

1082
01:15:24,333 --> 01:15:25,791
Maui, it's back.

1083
01:15:46,875 --> 01:15:48,083
Sorry, chicken.

1084
01:16:31,166 --> 01:16:32,208
Chee Hoo.

1085
01:18:11,458 --> 01:18:13,208
I figured it out.

1086
01:18:17,375 --> 01:18:20,333
You know, the ocean would love
when I would pull up the islands.

1087
01:18:20,416 --> 01:18:23,083
Your ancestors would voyage
her seas and find them.

1088
01:18:24,250 --> 01:18:27,333
That necklace you're wearing,
that belonged to Tautaivasa,

1089
01:18:27,416 --> 01:18:29,041
the first master wayfinder.

1090
01:18:29,708 --> 01:18:31,916
He knew no two voyages were the same.

1091
01:18:32,000 --> 01:18:33,083
Different every time.

1092
01:18:34,750 --> 01:18:36,125
A true wayfinder...

1093
01:18:37,458 --> 01:18:41,916
will see all the water... as a bridge...

1094
01:18:43,958 --> 01:18:44,958
and not a barrier.

1095
01:18:46,833 --> 01:18:48,583
And if I were the ocean,

1096
01:18:50,166 --> 01:18:53,375
I couldn't find a better curly-haired,

1097
01:18:53,458 --> 01:18:56,208
sidekick-having non-princess...

1098
01:18:59,791 --> 01:19:01,166
...to start voyaging again.

1099
01:19:01,875 --> 01:19:05,708
That is the nicest thing
you've ever said to me.

1100
01:19:05,791 --> 01:19:07,666
Probably should've saved it for Te Fiti.

1101
01:19:08,333 --> 01:19:09,333
I did.

1102
01:19:23,708 --> 01:19:25,916
- Moana, if I don't--
- You can do this.

1103
01:19:26,416 --> 01:19:27,416
You're Maui.

1104
01:19:30,791 --> 01:19:31,791
That's true.

1105
01:19:49,875 --> 01:19:51,541
It's Maui time.

1106
01:19:52,291 --> 01:19:53,791
Go save the world.

1107
01:19:55,958 --> 01:19:57,416
Chee Hoo!

1108
01:20:17,875 --> 01:20:19,083
Maui!

1109
01:20:40,916 --> 01:20:41,916
Maui.

1110
01:20:47,333 --> 01:20:49,541
We need to pull back. Now!

1111
01:20:54,333 --> 01:20:56,791
- What are you doing?
- Finding you a way in.

1112
01:20:57,375 --> 01:20:58,791
Now's our chance.

1113
01:20:59,833 --> 01:21:01,083
- Turn around.
- No.

1114
01:21:01,166 --> 01:21:02,833
- We're not gonna make it.
- Yes, we will.

1115
01:21:02,916 --> 01:21:05,125
- Moana, stop!
- No! I can do it.

1116
01:21:37,500 --> 01:21:38,666
Are you okay?

1117
01:21:39,833 --> 01:21:40,791
Maui?

1118
01:21:40,875 --> 01:21:42,166
I told you to turn back.

1119
01:21:43,375 --> 01:21:45,166
- I thought we could make it.
- "We"?

1120
01:21:51,166 --> 01:21:52,583
I thought I could make it.

1121
01:22:08,791 --> 01:22:10,166
I'll find a way to fix your hook.

1122
01:22:10,250 --> 01:22:12,166
The gods made my hook.

1123
01:22:12,666 --> 01:22:14,250
You can't fix it.

1124
01:22:14,875 --> 01:22:16,375
Next time I'll be more careful.

1125
01:22:16,458 --> 01:22:18,291
- There's no next time.
- But now we know

1126
01:22:18,375 --> 01:22:20,041
Te Kā can't follow us
into the water.

1127
01:22:20,125 --> 01:22:21,625
We can find another way around.

1128
01:22:21,708 --> 01:22:24,291
There is no other way. I'm not going back.

1129
01:22:24,375 --> 01:22:26,958
Take a look at my hook.
One more hit and it's over.

1130
01:22:27,041 --> 01:22:29,208
But my people, my island...

1131
01:22:29,291 --> 01:22:31,750
Without my hook,

1132
01:22:32,625 --> 01:22:34,125
I am nothing.

1133
01:22:34,208 --> 01:22:37,541
We're only here 'cause you stole the heart
in the first place.

1134
01:22:37,625 --> 01:22:38,625
No.

1135
01:22:39,291 --> 01:22:40,583
We're here

1136
01:22:40,666 --> 01:22:43,916
because the ocean told you
that you were special.

1137
01:22:45,500 --> 01:22:46,583
And you believed it.

1138
01:22:48,333 --> 01:22:50,500
- I am Moana of Motunui.
- Goodbye, Moana.

1139
01:22:50,583 --> 01:22:52,250
You will sail across the sea
and restore the heart...

1140
01:22:52,333 --> 01:22:54,708
I'm not killing myself so you can prove
you're something you're not.

1141
01:22:54,791 --> 01:22:57,958
The ocean chose me! It chose us!

1142
01:22:59,208 --> 01:23:00,416
It chose wrong.

1143
01:23:01,625 --> 01:23:03,250
- Goodbye, Moana.
- Maui!

1144
01:23:13,291 --> 01:23:15,666
Maui, no! Don't go!

1145
01:23:24,625 --> 01:23:25,541
Maui?

1146
01:23:38,083 --> 01:23:40,291
Ocean, why did you bring me here?

1147
01:23:43,166 --> 01:23:45,000
I was never the right person.

1148
01:23:50,791 --> 01:23:52,750
You should choose someone else.

1149
01:23:55,208 --> 01:23:56,541
Please.

1150
01:23:58,333 --> 01:23:59,333
Please.

1151
01:25:21,458 --> 01:25:24,375
You're a long ways past the reef.

1152
01:25:28,333 --> 01:25:29,625
Gramma.

1153
01:25:29,708 --> 01:25:32,958
I guess I chose the right tattoo.

1154
01:25:46,958 --> 01:25:49,041
I tried, Gramma, but...

1155
01:25:49,666 --> 01:25:51,166
I couldn't do it.

1156
01:25:52,375 --> 01:25:53,666
I can't do it.

1157
01:25:54,958 --> 01:25:57,125
If you're ready to go home,

1158
01:25:57,208 --> 01:25:59,250
I will be with you.

1159
01:26:15,916 --> 01:26:18,250
Why do you hesitate?

1160
01:26:23,208 --> 01:26:24,416
I don't know.

1161
01:26:25,708 --> 01:26:28,750
♪ <i>I know a girl from an island </i>♪

1162
01:26:29,291 --> 01:26:31,958
♪ <i>She stands apart from the crowd </i>♪

1163
01:26:32,750 --> 01:26:35,375
♪ <i>She loves the sea and her people </i>♪

1164
01:26:36,416 --> 01:26:39,083
♪ <i>She makes her whole family proud </i>♪

1165
01:26:39,833 --> 01:26:42,833
♪ <i>Sometimes the world seems against you </i>♪

1166
01:26:43,458 --> 01:26:46,208
♪ <i>The journey may leave a scar </i>♪

1167
01:26:46,958 --> 01:26:49,333
♪ <i>But scars can heal and reveal </i>♪

1168
01:26:49,416 --> 01:26:52,333
♪ <i>Just where you are... </i>♪

1169
01:26:54,125 --> 01:26:56,541
♪ <i>The people you love will change you </i>♪

1170
01:26:57,125 --> 01:26:59,750
♪ <i>The things you have learned</i>
<i>Will guide you </i>♪

1171
01:27:00,666 --> 01:27:03,333
♪ <i>And nothing on earth can silence </i>♪

1172
01:27:03,875 --> 01:27:07,083
♪ <i>The quiet voice still inside you </i>♪

1173
01:27:07,166 --> 01:27:10,291
♪ <i>And when that voice starts to whisper </i>♪

1174
01:27:10,833 --> 01:27:13,833
♪ <i>"Moana, you've come so far" </i>♪

1175
01:27:14,833 --> 01:27:16,250
♪ <i>Moana, listen... </i>♪

1176
01:27:16,875 --> 01:27:21,500
♪ <i>Do you know who you are? </i>♪

1177
01:27:24,500 --> 01:27:25,625
Who am I?

1178
01:27:28,500 --> 01:27:31,791
♪ <i>I am a girl who loves my island </i>♪

1179
01:27:31,875 --> 01:27:34,833
♪ <i>And the girl who loves the sea </i>♪

1180
01:27:36,375 --> 01:27:39,750
♪ <i>It calls me </i>♪

1181
01:27:41,583 --> 01:27:44,625
♪ <i>I am the daughter of the village chief </i>♪

1182
01:27:44,708 --> 01:27:47,833
♪ <i>We are descended from voyagers </i>♪

1183
01:27:47,916 --> 01:27:50,916
♪ <i>Who found their way across the world </i>♪

1184
01:27:51,000 --> 01:27:53,500
♪ <i>They call me </i>♪

1185
01:27:54,625 --> 01:27:56,791
♪ <i>I've delivered us to where we are </i>♪

1186
01:27:57,500 --> 01:27:59,833
♪ <i>I have journeyed farther </i>♪

1187
01:28:00,791 --> 01:28:03,125
♪ <i>I am everything I've learned and more </i>♪

1188
01:28:03,208 --> 01:28:06,833
♪ <i>Still it calls me </i>♪

1189
01:28:07,375 --> 01:28:09,500
♪ <i>And the call isn't out there at all </i>♪

1190
01:28:09,583 --> 01:28:12,500
♪ <i>It's inside me </i>♪

1191
01:28:12,583 --> 01:28:14,500
♪ <i>It's like the tide </i>♪

1192
01:28:14,583 --> 01:28:19,125
♪ <i>Always falling and rising </i>♪

1193
01:28:19,208 --> 01:28:21,750
♪ <i>I will carry you here in my heart </i>♪

1194
01:28:21,833 --> 01:28:24,791
♪ <i>You remind me </i>♪

1195
01:28:24,875 --> 01:28:27,458
♪ <i>That come what may </i>♪

1196
01:28:27,541 --> 01:28:30,500
♪ <i>I know the way </i>♪

1197
01:28:30,583 --> 01:28:35,125
♪ <i>I am Moana! </i>♪

1198
01:29:02,750 --> 01:29:04,791
<i>I am Moana of Motunui.</i>

1199
01:29:04,875 --> 01:29:07,791
<i>I am Moana of Motunui.</i>

1200
01:29:07,875 --> 01:29:09,416
<i>- You will board my boat...</i>
<i>- ...board my boat...</i>

1201
01:29:09,916 --> 01:29:12,375
<i>- ...sail across the sea...</i>
<i>- ...sail across the sea...</i>

1202
01:29:12,458 --> 01:29:14,833
<i>and restore the heart of Te Fiti.</i>

1203
01:29:31,416 --> 01:29:34,708
We have to lure Te Kā away
and slip past,

1204
01:29:35,250 --> 01:29:38,916
'cause it can't follow us
through the water to Te Fiti.

1205
01:29:41,291 --> 01:29:44,791
None of which you understand
because you are a chicken.

1206
01:29:54,208 --> 01:29:55,291
All right, Te Kā.

1207
01:29:55,916 --> 01:29:57,250
Try and catch me.

1208
01:31:04,291 --> 01:31:05,458
Come on!

1209
01:31:12,041 --> 01:31:13,458
No, no, no, no, no, no, no!

1210
01:31:22,000 --> 01:31:23,041
Heihei.

1211
01:31:24,750 --> 01:31:25,791
Nice work.

1212
01:31:34,416 --> 01:31:35,416
Te Fiti.

1213
01:32:17,333 --> 01:32:18,375
You came back.

1214
01:32:18,458 --> 01:32:19,666
I never should've left.

1215
01:32:23,375 --> 01:32:24,708
But your hook...

1216
01:32:24,791 --> 01:32:27,083
- One more hit...
- Te Kā's gotta catch me first.

1217
01:32:35,583 --> 01:32:36,958
Maui.

1218
01:32:38,375 --> 01:32:39,375
Thank you.

1219
01:32:40,291 --> 01:32:41,541
